    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="5a7d14fe-4d7f-579e-a5de-a82e0b13dac2" activityNameId="89694d82-1a5d-531b-9d4f-e78bcaff3320" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Technical wood drying, infrastructure</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Technical wood drying, infrastructure
The service life is assumed to be 50 years. The kiln has a capacity of 30 m3 wood per charge. Drying time depends on wood type and in- and output moisture content. This data must only be used to consider the infrastructure needed for kiln drying wood if this is not relevant.;
Synonyms: kiln, Trocknungskammer; 
UUID: 6af61017-3945-3789-be63-c211159170a9
The land area and the materials and their transports needed for building and disposal of a kiln with a per charge loading capacity of 30 m3 wood (under bark) are included. Not included is the land used for storage etc.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Medium sized kiln of polystyren foam insulated aluminium panels, located with sawmill
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: estimation 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6af61017-3945-3789-be63-c211159170a9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
